{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "033shr_403_2_4_033_03_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:02701b18d85b95fc3c181646c64bfde14df83984be6c57f2fa654a7df3cb21cd",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:033shr_403_2_4_033_03_09_a:2_4_033_03_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a3e93c9c056573874c588a31b2861f79ff38c721b555753526b77dacbb10e30",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，辛苦啦！\n今天的录制也超开心的——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:033shr_403_2_4_033_03_09_a:2_4_033_03_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3daf7f2166badd14b53b2cc42a48034dfc1d97ce0f337bce9bcdeedd4e0b9e5c",
      "text": "站在讲台上原来是那种感觉啊。\n视线看到的景象和平时完全反过来，超有意思的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:033shr_403_2_4_033_03_09_a:2_4_033_03_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:068b7dd203423dde2dbebf23a713371ba98c62485fee42d2feb0ced9069320af",
      "text": "不过，那个综艺节目的录制，\n今天这期录完就暂时告一段落了吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:033shr_403_2_4_033_03_09_a:2_4_033_03_09_a:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f81df0589643a488acbdc6dc06a567a0e6ecf872f17800bebb00f18a9d8d9bb8",
      "text": "倒也不是觉得寂寞啦！我明明还可以\n教大家更多东西的说。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:033shr_403_2_4_033_03_09_a:2_4_033_03_09_a:cmd-000014:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:836746db8532f9865a863e6f8eb35d23bac442a95fb13a82dcf7547e20cabac7",
      "text": "一定能为下一次机会打下基础的",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:033shr_403_2_4_033_03_09_a:2_4_033_03_09_a:cmd-000015:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f187d9ec91b8d9a152a4dd22e86c66e7ac905d19dd88ca2de68dcae9dd237f8",
      "text": "你是个非常出色的老师！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:033shr_403_2_4_033_03_09_a:2_4_033_03_09_a:cmd-000018:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1cd8ed24bf3c2cc7b770b23bfbaf19d80b38aaba5b7b49788d74dfd52e58b138",
      "text": "嗯……就是说嘛——！老师的角色我演得超完美，\n大家肯定也想再看吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:033shr_403_2_4_033_03_09_a:2_4_033_03_09_a:cmd-000022:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29965877288a174fc445518144e12a815499c0a82de1a1751b007516fc2cd6bc",
      "text": "嘿嘿，那是当然的啦！制作人要是有什么\n想让我教你的，也尽管开口哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:033shr_403_2_4_033_03_09_a:2_4_033_03_09_a:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d08d37308c6cfa1167ab71d8cd5531f95fdd826e90eb74bb981c7eb7b615d997",
      "text": "……好嘞，为了以后随时能再去出演，\n我也得好好学习才行！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:033shr_403_2_4_033_03_09_a:2_4_033_03_09_a:cmd-000028:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94f2fdf5e01d18d09796b6949eb77199608d8ac051a27bd7d7139d61ff2bcee0",
      "text": "作业也是……虽然有时候觉得麻烦，但我会加油的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:033shr_403_2_4_033_03_09_a:2_4_033_03_09_a:cmd-000030:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ff780d37626ecd2e8a1fb1f913a72e20d65c726104ccdcb31291454ab94627e",
      "text": "这次一起录制的人教我做功课，\n也挺有意思的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:033shr_403_2_4_033_03_09_a:2_4_033_03_09_a:cmd-000032:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f8705611e390009811effb1b7e63de91261ad726ae3dbfebebfbf89417d8f773",
      "text": "我为你加油！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:033shr_403_2_4_033_03_09_a:2_4_033_03_09_a:cmd-000035:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0834d3e9eb8dfdfe6b57326dac0cfee9f9e361f262a2e7f5e7d1a7158b96bee1",
      "text": "谢啦！我会成为更了不起的男人的，\n你就好好看着吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:033shr_403_2_4_033_03_09_a:2_4_033_03_09_a:cmd-000037:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:91ac1c4571fc5bf7d0fe37efba417987087978282038162a2505b3edaf3dc00a",
      "text": "那我今天先睡啦，挂电话咯！\n晚安，制作人。明天见！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
